<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Afrikander in talks, cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>Afrikander in talks, cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Afrikander Lease Ltd said on Thursday it was in talks with certain parties regarding the future of the Afrikander Lease area of Vaal Reefs Exploration and Mining Co Ltd.</p>
<p>It said the talks were expected to be concluded by the end of August, at which time a further announcement would be made.</p>
<p>Until then, shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
